Package: parallelbayes
Type: Package
Title: Auditable Experiments with Time Parallel Markov Chain Monte Carlo
Version: 0.2.0.9002
Authors@R: person("ParallelBayes", "Project", email = "parallelbayes@example.invalid", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A research interface to fixed-noise sequential and time parallel
    Markov chain Monte Carlo experiments. Separates targets, kernels, executors,
    numerical validation and cost records. Uses optional native torch or JAX models or a CPU
    BridgeStan provider, with explicit capability and failure reporting.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports: reticulate, posterior, jsonlite
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Python (>= 3.11); optional PyTorch or JAX/BlackJAX; C++ compiler and BridgeStan source for Stan models
